我只会一直跪着，我享受跪着也渴望跪着，我的相处模式就是24/7，我的需求也只有24/7可以满足我❤️","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114686156185153881"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114684634898567505"],"id":"2114684634898567505","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2554,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"四轮居然就猜中了！！！ https://t.co/hIxObiku9p","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114684634898567505"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-26T09:20:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114648438172467375"],"id":"2114648438172467375","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":20426,"like_count":152,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我很好奇自己裸着磕头是什么样子，就拍了一下\n拍了之后发现自己的身体曲线好美\n我好奇上位在看到下位裸着磕头的时候也会感叹很美吗？","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114648438172467375"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-26T09:12:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114646336213860850"],"id":"2114646336213860850","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2235,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"跟新监护的相处很意外的合得来，原来这就是缘分吗！？\n我不算是一个健谈的人，但是我跟她在一起就特别话多！！\n好开心！！\n我们的星座和MBTI也特别的合得来！！ https://t.co/wlKl3CXiHu","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114646336213860850"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-25T13:15:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114345067582243015"],"id":"2114345067582243015","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":5833,"like_count":50,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":4},"text":"很难找到好的上位并不都是因为好的都有下位了……\n别忘了上位也是对下位有要求的呀……\n好的上位往往要求会更多\n也有一直找不到下位的好上位呀\n\n所以只要真诚，努力提升自己，总会等到属于自己的上位的！","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114345067582243015"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-25T13:01:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114341644179063203"],"id":"2114341644179063203","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3349,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":0},"text":"在光遇d到了一个巨美的监护姐姐\n我不是没人要的崽了❗❗😡","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114341644179063203"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:35:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114244552207007800"],"id":"2114244552207007800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":11505,"like_count":88,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":2},"text":"虽然但素，说到对sub的要求的话\n我觉得就是有经济基础和主体性\n对于下位来说有经济基础真的很重要……\nbdsm很容易让下位对上位产生依赖，现在圈子里的很多下位也会把“上位给零花钱”当作理所当然，我并不提倡……也觉得这样并不是BDSM而是包养……","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114244552207007800"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-25T06:28:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114242787734639094"],"id":"2114242787734639094","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":7157,"like_count":46,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114065537366135078","type":"quoted"}],"text":"是的，bdsm和包养的区别就是非物质。\n我虽然也看重经济，但事实上我完全不需要对方给我零花钱，我看重经济条件是因为在我看来这是一部分实力的体现\n有稳定的收入，能保持业余爱好，有存款，在我看来就足够了 https://t.co/OYAF25CQim","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114242787734639094"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-25T04:08:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114207325649240067"],"id":"2114207325649240067","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3684,"like_count":21,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"事实上BDSM里的部分玩法可以去告故意伤害，一告一个准\n所以下位实际上是这段关系里的主导者。上位对下位做的事是需要下位的同意，并且下位也在享受之中的\n所以下位们不要忘记这一点，在关系中委屈求全呀\nBDSM是角色扮演游戏，就算是全天候的也依旧是角色扮演游戏","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114207325649240067"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T15:02:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114009751210414536"],"id":"2114009751210414536","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":5636,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":1},"text":"以下只是幻想\n不要现充dom\n学历必须要比我高或者跟我齐平。\n学习能力好，对待工作，事业有上进心。\n独居，收入稳定经济独立有经济基础，眼界，认知水平高于我，知识面广。\n有教养，做事不拖沓有规划。\n不抽烟少喝酒，有健身或运动习惯。身材要正常身材，长相不要脸歪嘴斜，身高最少180+。 https://t.co/7pQodo7iii","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114009751210414536"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T14:56:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114008147744678053"],"id":"2114008147744678053","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2528,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🐇越谈越爱\n🐇我都会看的，其它里我也会看。如果没回可以再发一次提醒我，可能是忘了 https://t.co/rG1qACVAly","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114008147744678053"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T14:55:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114007853191332240"],"id":"2114007853191332240","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2380,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🐇？\n🐇我有朋友。\n🐇不爱吃鸡蛋\n🐇四川菜好辣我不吃辣，可恶 https://t.co/JztvoAGXok","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114007853191332240"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T14:42:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114004713935081628"],"id":"2114004713935081628","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2358,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"希望某天后主能从天而降，他在上面仙女下凡我在下面真爱降临","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2114004713935081628"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T13:02:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113979403005026435"],"id":"2113979403005026435","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":11040,"like_count":145,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":9},"text":"其实我最理想的生活就是纯主奴24/7，ddlg的模式为日常相处模式（像称呼什么的），被半圈养……跟主人住在一起，被24/7的管控监视什么的……\n当然前提是在一起久了，关系稳定彼此信任😡而且1v1😡\n主人只有我一条狗还不够吗😡只能属于我😡","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2113979403005026435"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T12:52:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113976860237578377"],"id":"2113976860237578377","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2522,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"噢噢还有\n看到一些帖子连带着玩圈养的也一起骂了\n但是有些人就是喜欢圈养这个玩法🥹🙌🏻（我）\n控制好时间，程度什么的，其实还好的。像也有只持续一两周的圈养，结束后继续回到原来相处模式的主奴……\n圈养跟包养还是有区别的🙌🏻","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2113976860237578377"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T12:27:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113970714034532715"],"id":"2113970714034532715","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":15100,"like_count":124,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":0},"text":"首先我觉得那篇sub圈养帖子的贴主有问题，并不是维护。他描述的“被圈养的幸福生活”具有误导性，会让不知情者忽视圈养的危险。\n\n先说他对下位的要求的话，其实我能理解\n因为这些就是圈养的基本项（离开上位就会死除外）（其实我以为是夸张来着）","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2113970714034532715"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T11:41:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113958989604216995"],"id":"2113958989604216995","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2138,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今天来后室玩 https://t.co/RP5Wd5VcN5","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2113958989604216995"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T06:12:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113876182194409800"],"id":"2113876182194409800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2114,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113662858114572625","type":"quoted"}],"text":"推特以为我要自杀我不行了 https://t.co/RtsCCRmML3 https://t.co/evvy2q2Pbk","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2113876182194409800"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-24T06:05:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113874615768633491"],"id":"2113874615768633491","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":10088,"like_count":149,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":15,"retweet_coun